        + (273 + 364) * (2 ^ 4352 * M * p)
        + (94 + 1) * 2 ^ 4224 * (M * p * (r - 1))) * 2 ^ 100)
      (2 ^ 4352 * M * p * (r - 1)) = true := by decide +kernel

/-- The constant is `2^-104.538`, `0.04305` of the unit; the room is a factor `23.2`: it survives 16 times its value. -/
